# Vienna Life Assistant - Project Rules

## Overview
Personal life management app + MCP server for Vienna life admin: calendar, todos,
expenses, health (doctor visits, medications, vitals), travel (trips, packing,
documents), contacts (people, birthdays), and household (subscriptions, home tasks,
pet care). Backend + MCP at 127.0.0.1:10922, frontend (Vite) at 127.0.0.1:10988.

## Tech Stack (web_sota/ is the active surface)
- **Frontend**: React 19 + TypeScript + Vite 7 + TailwindCSS 3 + Radix UI + Lucide
- **Backend**: FastAPI + FastMCP 3.4.x + SQLAlchemy 2 (SQLite at web_sota/data/vilife.db)
- **Desktop**: Tauri 2.0 + NSIS (native/)
- **Legacy (do not extend)**: backend/ (Django-style API + Celery), frontend/ (React 18 + MUI)

## Development Standards

### TypeScript/React
- Functional components with hooks, TypeScript strict
- Tailwind dark theme (Zinc base, cosmos purple accent #8B5CF6)
- `data-testid` on interactive elements (fleet CUA/Playwright targeting)

### Python/FastAPI
- Type hints required; FastAPI async; Pydantic v2 (`model_dump`, not `.dict()`)
- SQLAlchemy 2.0 style; new life domains follow the pattern in
  `vienna_life_assistant/life_db.py` + `life_db_routes.py` (generic CRUD)
- New MCP ops go into the portmanteau tools in `vienna_life_mcp.py`
  (operation Literal + docstring with `## Return Format` + `## Examples`)

### Data
- One source of truth: SQLite via `vienna_life_assistant/db.py`
- First-run seed in `life_db.seed_if_empty` — never present mock data as real

## Windows/PowerShell Compliance
- No `&&` or `||` operators in .ps1; use `;`
- PowerShell cmdlets (Get-ChildItem, Remove-Item); no `ls`/`cat`/`grep`

## File Organization
```
web_sota/
  vienna_life_assistant/   # FastAPI app + MCP + SQLAlchemy models
    db.py                  # engine/session/init
    models.py              # all life-domain tables
    life_db.py             # CRUD + seed + aggregations
    life_db_routes.py      # generic CRUD REST routers
    vienna_life_mcp.py     # portmanteau MCP tools
  src/pages/               # React pages (Health, Contacts, Household, ...)
```

## Locale
- Currency Euro (€), dates ISO (YYYY-MM-DD), timezone Europe/Vienna
- Stores: Spar, Billa, Hofer, DM; transit: Wiener Linien (U4/tram)

